Z||000000||DecadenceR||06-06-2001||10:47 PM||||Tomorrow I'm looking at an 87SE.<BR>Originally i was asking the kid about parts, but it seems they're wiling to sell the whole thing pretty cheap. I'll find out how cheap tomorrow - tonight he said a couple hundred.<BR>Anyway, it needs a front facia which I wanted to replace that anyway... Front windshield which I was gonna swap the roof because I want to keep my sunroof. And a door handle. No sweat.<BR>So my question is what should I look at/for on this car? Anything I need to check or look at? Buyer beware type thing?<p>[This message has been edited by DecadenceR (edited 06-07-2001).]||||reg||1
